Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.26,0:29:53.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 继续 大家唱得很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, keep it coming. All right, people, good work!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.30,0:29:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,记着 还有两星期就是歌唱比赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, don't forget. The state competition's a couple of weeks away, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.04,0:29:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家加把劲 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}so keep on it, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.05,0:30:11.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错啊 基斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not bad, Chris.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.79,0:30:14.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.12,0:30:17.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 你叫海瑟 对不对？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, uh, Heather, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.56,0:30:19.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.56,0:30:22.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你唱法兰仙纳杜拉腔\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you've got this sort of Frank Sinatra thing going on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.16,0:30:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我最近才发现自己有音乐细胞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. I feel like I've discovered this whole new side of me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.90,0:30:29.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,音乐最能表达感情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, uh, music is so expressive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.47,0:30:33.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 我是说…我同意 但…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. I mean, I agree, but…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.21,0:30:36.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你经常在球场上拼搏…\N{\fnArial\fs30}aren't you supposed to be out, like, trying to decapitate someone…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.34,0:30:40.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抽得出时间来练歌吗？- 哦 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}- with your lacrosse stick or something? - Oh, sure. Sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.42,0:30:42.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道大家对我的看法\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I know what people think. It's like, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.58,0:30:45.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,「欧兹只是个浑球」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Oz, he's just this kick- ass lacrosse player."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.72,0:30:48.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 我确实喜欢打球 顺便说一下 即便如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I also play football, by the way, but that's, like, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.49,0:30:51.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但我不仅仅是个球员 - 当然 我并不…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- that's not all that I am, you know? - Of course, I didn't…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.86,0:30:54.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,被人否定 我总觉得不公平\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it really bothers me when people try to pigeonhole me like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.96,0:30:57.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.00,0:31:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为我不了解么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I don't get that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.94,0:31:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我不喝酒喝到一塌糊涂…\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, it's like just because I don't get drunk and barf every weekend…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.37,0:31:08.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,人家就把我形容为假正经\N{\fnArial\fs30}that people say, "Oh, look. There's this Goody Two- Shoes choirgirl priss."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.71,0:31:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么你除了唱歌 还有什么活动？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. So, like, what else do you do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.12,0:31:16.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the same things you do, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.52,0:31:19.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,和朋友一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}like hang out with friends and stuff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.55,0:31:21.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你以为我会有什么活动？- 哦 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why? What do you think I do? - Oh, I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.06,0:31:25.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,说起来 我对你一无所知\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just realized that I don't know anything about you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.13,0:31:30.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不过我有兴趣知道 - 我希望能够多了解你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I was interested. - Oh, well, what do you want to know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.37,0:31:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道…我也想了解你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, stuff… about you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.71,0:31:38.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.21,0:31:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈 无回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom, I'm home!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.43,0:31:50.39,Note,0,0,0,0,,（吉姆 你爱吃的苹果派 妈妈）
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.87,0:32:41.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 耶 哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah. Oh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.61,0:32:49.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 吉姆？- 并不是你想的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jim! - It's not what it looks like.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.45,0:32:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么…我只好告诉你妈妈 嗯…那什么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we'll just tell your mother that, uh… that, uh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.75,0:32:59.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们把苹果批吃掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we ate it all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.50,0:33:21.47,Note,0,0,0,0,,（注意：胆小勿效舌头秘笈）
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.43,0:33:42.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,8号欧兹入球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goal by number eight, Chris Ostreicher.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.77,0:33:48.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 精彩的比赛 - 精彩的比赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nice game. - Nice game. Good game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.61,0:33:55.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你来看球？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what are you doin' here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.64,0:33:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是第一次来 特来欣赏你的精湛球技\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just enjoying my first exhilarating lacrosse experience.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.15,0:34:01.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你很厉害 - 哦 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You kicked butt. - Oh, thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.78,0:34:04.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯 基斯 - 你可以叫我欧兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Um, Chris… - Oh, you can call me Oz, if you want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.85,0:34:07.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我一定要吗？- 或者欧兹卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do I have to? - You can call me Ostreicher.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.29,0:34:09.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还有什么名字？- 啊 算了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's your middle name? - Nah, forget it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.52,0:34:13.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不会告诉别人 - 我也不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on. I won't tell anyone. - Well, neither will I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.16,0:34:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧…嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Um.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.87,0:34:20.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有个提议\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I had this thought and…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.47,0:34:22.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,说出来似乎冒昧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It may seem like it's way out of left field.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.80,0:34:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不知你的意思是怎样 我没有男朋友 或者…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know if you can, but since I'm not going with anybody, I thought that maybe…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.48,0:34:30.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们全都是饭桶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those guys sucked ass!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.21,0:34:32.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,合唱团的小妞 你来干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Choir chick, what the hell are you doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.48,0:34:37.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是来邀请基斯一起参加毕业舞会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, uh, I was asking Chris to prom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.32,0:34:39.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么…你愿意吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, do you want to go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.39,0:34:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 好啊 太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah! That would be great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.92,0:34:46.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,别奢望欧兹有豪华车接送\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, just don't expect Oz to pay for the limo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.26,0:34:49.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,史勒 去你的 我是说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stifler, fuck! I mean…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.40,0:34:53.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么总不能体贴一点？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you got to be so insensitive all the time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.97,0:34:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.37,0:35:00.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,懒得理你 别忘了 舞会之后有派对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever. Look, uh, don't forget. My cottage after prom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.84,0:35:03.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,到我湖畔别墅来\N{\fnArial\fs30}On Lake Michigan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.35,0:35:05.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 等一等 你小子到哪里去？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, wait up, you pussies. Where you goin'?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.91,0:35:11.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 好吧 我要…我要去洗澡了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, well, I gotta… I gotta hit the showers now, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.35,0:35:14.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴一起参加舞会 感觉真的很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I think this is gonna be really, really good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.76,0:35:18.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯 我也是 - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. Me too. - All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.76,0:35:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 再见 - 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bye. - Bye. Bye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.27,0:35:30.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 欧兹 你真行！- 追合唱团的乖乖女？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Appenin Oz! - Working with the choir chick?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.51,0:35:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,没办法 她穿T恤好迷人\N{\fnArial\fs30}What d'ya say, fellas? I just dig those cute little sweaters she wears.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.18,0:35:38.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你艳福不浅啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nuts you do, you little horn dog.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.48,0:35:41.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶 耶 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah! Yeah, baby!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.12,0:35:45.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟蹋我吧 帅哥 叫床叫出高音C来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spank me! Spank me! Hit that high "C."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.53,0:35:52.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎样追到的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! What's goin' on here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.67,0:36:00.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很自私 根本不体贴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was being selfish and majorly insensitive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.60,0:36:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个蠢才 苯蛋 畜牲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a… I'm a total idiot. I mean, a fool, a buffoon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.57,0:36:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,总之你是个坏蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think shithead really says it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.17,0:36:10.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得对 我是个坏蛋 我想补偿你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? You're right. I'm a shithead, and I want to make it up to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.65,0:36:13.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 怎么补偿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah? How?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.75,0:36:16.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 哦…哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Oh. Oh. Ohh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.79,0:36:19.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,维琪 嘘 你爸妈在楼下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vicky. Shh. Your parents are downstairs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.52,0:36:22.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 凯文 不要停 - 等一等\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Kevin, don't stop! - Just a second.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.06,0:36:30.03,Note,0,0,0,0,,（舌功秘笈）
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.05,0:36:38.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 叫维琪下来吃饭好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hon, can you tell Vic to come on down for supper?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.32,0:36:44.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真他妈厉害 - 嘘 你的门没有上锁\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Holy shit! - Shh. You know there's no lock on your door?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.69,0:36:52.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我来了 我来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ohh! I'm coming! I'm coming!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.24,0:36:59.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 吉姆 - 爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, Jim! - Dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.25,0:37:02.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 我正在看我们一家的合照\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, I was just looking at the old family portrait out here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.62,0:37:05.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时很开心 对不对？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that was a fun day wasn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.35,0:37:07.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦 是的 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, yeah. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.85,0:37:12.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉姆 我想谈谈自慰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jim, I want to talk about masturbation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.42,0:37:16.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,自慰是绝对正常的行为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I just want you to know that it's- it's a perfectly normal, uh, thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.76,0:37:18.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,无可否认 你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I have to admit, uh, you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.00,0:37:23.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我年轻时也成天想着上小妞\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did a fair bit of masturbating when I was a little younger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.54,0:37:27.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我…嗯… - 我戏称为打手枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I, uh… - I used to call it "stroking the salami."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.74,0:37:30.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 还有舞单节辊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you know, "pounding the ol' pud."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.44,0:37:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我从没用过糕点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never did it with baked goods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.18,0:37:37.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的大伯天天都打手枪 每天打五六次\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you know your Uncle Mort? He "pinched the one- eyed snake" five, six times a day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.72,0:37:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像…赛前的练习\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, it's like, uh, practice for the big game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.99,0:37:45.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白吗？就像…就像…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see? It's like… It's like…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.19,0:37:48.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,独自对着墙壁练网球\N{\fnArial\fs30}banging a tennis ball against a brick wall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.16,0:37:52.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然能过手瘾 但总不及对打\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which can be fun. It can be fun, but it's not a game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.20,0:37:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对…嗯 - 这不是比赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Right. No. - It's not a game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.10,0:37:58.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,对打要有对手 球来球往\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you want is you want a partner to return the ball.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.60,0:38:02.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你要不要对手？- 嗯 我需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you want a partner? - Yeah, Yeah, I want a partner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.24,0:38:04.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真的要对手？- 哦 真的需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You do want a partner? - Oh, I want a partner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.21,0:38:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你要对手 是好事 - 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Want a partner. Good. Good. - Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.31,0:38:10.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.28,0:38:14.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,因此 贺尔一旦登基…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, once Hal becomes king, he has to take on…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.85,0:38:17.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,就要肩负重任 抛开他的老友…\N{\fnArial\fs30}the responsibilities of leadership and turn his back…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.29,0:38:19.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,醉汉科士达\N{\fnArial\fs30}on his old, drunken friend, Falstaff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.66,0:38:24.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,贺尔面临人生转折点 就像你们一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, Hal is going through a… rite of passage, much like you all are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.43,0:38:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们聚会时光已不多 要好好珍惜\N{\fnArial\fs30}So make most of the time you've got left together. You'll miss it later.{\r}
