Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.14,0:54:55.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为明天测验？有时候我也会…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it because we have a test tomorrow? Sometimes I get cranky…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.38,0:54:58.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我每逢测试都心情恶劣\N{\fnArial\fs30}when I know I have a big test to study for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.71,0:55:03.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对了 肯定是测验的缘故 - 我也认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. Yeah, that's pretty much it. - I thought so…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.12,0:55:05.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那次在音乐营… - 你叫什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- because this one time at band camp… - What's your name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.89,0:55:07.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 蜜雪儿 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Michelle. - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.82,0:55:09.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,蜜雪儿 嗯…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michelle, um…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.89,0:55:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯做我的舞伴吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want to be my date for the prom?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.76,0:55:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,做你舞件？你真的邀请我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? You seriously want to go with me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.74,0:55:22.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的邀请你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Seriously.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.94,0:55:26.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,舞会后去史勒的派对 好吗？那一定更酷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we going to Steve Stifler's party afterwards? Because that would be so cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.61,0:55:31.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 只要你喜欢 - 好呀 我们会好开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sure, whatever you want. - Cool! We're gonna have such a good time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.02,0:55:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像有一次音乐营的野火会…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll be like this one time at band camp when we all had a campfire…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.90,0:55:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.07,0:55:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎知道我在这里？- 史勒告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How'd you know I was here? - Stifler told me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.77,0:56:02.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你问史勒？- 我想找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Talked to Stifler? - Well, I needed to find you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.25,0:56:04.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要练歌\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna have to work on that song.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.58,0:56:08.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 很高兴你来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. I'm glad you came by.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.58,0:56:10.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你开夜班？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you work nights?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.12,0:56:15.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我爸爸是这里的经理 - 真的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My dad's the manager. - Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.03,0:56:19.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了 他的三文治真好吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cool. Tell him the subs are great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.16,0:56:24.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你明年上密西根大学？- 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So you're going to Michigan next year? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.13,0:56:26.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸妈希望我能够上西北大学\N{\fnArial\fs30}My parents want me to go to Northwestern, but…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.94,0:56:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,西北要我作一篇文章\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't wanna write all those extra essays they make you do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.87,0:56:35.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我懒得去作 题目叫「感情最珍贵的一刻」\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, how am I supposed to know what my "most emotionally significant moment" was?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.75,0:56:40.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以密大一答应收我 我就选密大\N{\fnArial\fs30}So when my "U" of "M" acceptance came in December, I just said the hell with it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.38,0:56:42.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 洋葱 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Onions? - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.49,0:56:45.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,要洋葱吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, uh, want onions?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.09,0:56:47.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.79,0:56:52.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打算主修哪科？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what are you gonna major in?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.46,0:56:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,州立大学的商科 我会加入大学的球队\N{\fnArial\fs30}State's got a good business school, and I could probably walk- on to the lacrosse team.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.60,0:57:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么都安排好了 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you've probably got it pretty figured out, then, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.57,0:57:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,读商科 打球 我都有兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, business is okay, and lacrosse is awesome, but…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.27,0:57:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,至于会不会做职业球员\N{\fnArial\fs30}what am I gonna be, a professional lacrosse player?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.44,0:57:09.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也拿不定主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really have no idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.45,0:57:12.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为只有自己才没主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank God. I thought I was the only one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.85,0:57:14.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不只你一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you're not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.25,0:57:18.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 明年我们会很接近\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we're gonna be close next year.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.26,0:57:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你指我们的两间大学很接近？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean East Lansing and Ann Arbor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.27,0:57:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.70,0:57:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talkin' about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.67,0:57:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能做你舞会的舞伴 我要等另一个人邀请\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't go to the prom with you. I'm holding out for someone else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.77,0:57:39.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在开玩笑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta be fuckin' kidding me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.04,0:57:44.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望芬奇肯邀请我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it's a long shot, but I figure Paul Finch might ask me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.48,0:57:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,芬奇 回家拉屎的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finch. Shit- brick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.58,0:57:51.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我一时忘记说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, gosh. I- I forgot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.35,0:57:53.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你复原得很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.86,0:57:57.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 脸上没有留下疤痕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I- I mean, the scars healed really well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.39,0:57:59.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 史勒 - 去死！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, Stifler. - Eat shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.17,0:58:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that all about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.20,0:58:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他被芬奇打过 觉得很没面子 - 谁告诉你的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's still embarrassed because Finch kicked his ass. - Who told you that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.67,0:58:10.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思？「无可奉告」？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean, "no comment"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.91,0:58:13.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你和芬奇有一腿吗？- 开什么玩笑 当然没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you two hook up or something? - What, are you kidding? No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.04,0:58:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么说芬奇那样威猛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then how did all this get started?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.68,0:58:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 现在说穿了也无所谓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I guess it's all right for me to tell you now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.98,0:58:24.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正他已经威尽了…帮我拿点奶酪\N{\fnArial\fs30}That reputation of his isn't going anywhere. Cheese, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.25,0:58:27.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,芬奇找到我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finch comes up to me and says, "Jessica, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.29,0:58:29.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要我的帮助 一大堆废话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need your help with this, blah, blah, etcetera."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.99,0:58:32.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就说：「可以 给我200块\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I said, "All right. Pay me 200 bucks, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.43,0:58:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我向女生说你床上功夫一级棒「\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'll tell a couple of girls that you're dynamite in bed."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.36,0:58:38.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他给钱 我说好话\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he did, and I did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.20,0:58:40.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有效果吗？- 当然有效\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That actually works? - Well, duh! Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.37,0:58:42.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,实际上 我添油加醋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Naturally, I embellished a little bit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.91,0:58:45.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听说芬奇和成熟的女人搞上了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you hear that Finch had an affair with an older woman?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.51,0:58:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 这我倒没听过\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I didn't hear that one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.51,0:58:50.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我得意之作\N{\fnArial\fs30}That one was my favorite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.18,0:58:52.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,上过啦啦队队长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do that cheerleader.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.25,0:58:55.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,她想要我 她打电话给我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wants me. She calls me up…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.39,0:59:03.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天啊 原来你是同性恋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God, you're gay!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.59,0:59:05.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,一起唱嘛 你知道歌词\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sing it with me. You know the words.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.59,0:59:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想得倒美 你日唱夜唱 唱足一星期\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, thanks, man. You've been singin' that shit all week.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.90,0:59:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,星期六出赛 不准你再唱\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you try that at M.S.U. This Saturday, I'll kick your ass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.67,0:59:14.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,星期六最后一场球赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our last game is this Saturday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.74,0:59:16.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 哦 糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.81,0:59:23.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有场重要球赛 最后一场\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got this lacrosse game. It's really important. It's our last game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.95,0:59:27.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,上次中区打赢 今次我要还击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Central almost beat us last time, so this time I really wanna kick their ass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.78,0:59:30.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,赛事在州立大学举行\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's gonna be cool, because the game's at State, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.59,0:59:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,赛后我可以去听你们演唱\N{\fnArial\fs30}which means afterwards I'll be able to stop by.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.22,0:59:35.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 你不能参加演唱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you can't sing at the competition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.29,0:59:38.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我今趟无法参加\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heather, I'm sorry. I totally blew it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.09,0:59:42.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要紧 你应该选择你的兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. You should… do what makes you happy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.43,0:59:48.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 谢谢你能谅解\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Listen, thanks for understanding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.24,0:59:50.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.77,0:59:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 再见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, uh, I guess I'll see you later?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.91,0:59:56.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm- hmm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.59,1:00:11.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Kevin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.86,1:00:16.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有没有见过回家拉屎的人吗？- 怎么了？他得罪了你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You seen shit-brick lately? - Why? What did you do to him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.93,1:00:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,得罪我？怎会得罪我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me? Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.10,1:00:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他打我打到我怕嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, I'm the one whose ass he kicked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.47,1:00:24.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我可以告诉你一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, uh, I'll tell you one thing, though.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.01,1:00:28.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,从此他要在校厕拉屎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think he's gonna have a problem shitting in school anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.31,1:00:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在他的朱古力奶下了泻药\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slipped a little something into his mochaccino.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.78,1:00:35.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.52,1:00:38.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! Oh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.86,1:00:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.23,1:00:49.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边请 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right this way, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.21,1:00:59.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.90,1:01:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.27,1:01:32.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕业舞会肯定会很好玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna be fun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.51,1:01:35.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好玩？乐队差劲 布置九流\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know it's just gonna be some crappy band and stupid decorations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.15,1:01:38.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有舞伴才这样说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just saying that because prom's a week away and you don't have a date.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.85,1:01:41.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不…我不用舞伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. I don't want a date.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.38,1:01:45.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,芬奇单身去参加 我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finch is goin' stag and… so am I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.96,1:01:49.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,芬奇真潇洒啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, he's like so… refined.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.29,1:01:52.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他真的搭上年长女人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think that older woman thing is true?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.53,1:01:55.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的 对方是史勒的妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's true. It was Stifler's mom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.90,1:02:01.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,钟妮 你制造的噪音？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Joanie, was that you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.30,1:02:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦 - 忍无可忍\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh! - Can't hold it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.67,1:02:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.65,1:02:12.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eww!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.40,1:02:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.74,1:02:42.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯文 今学期我们的感情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kev? I think we've come…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.78,1:02:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 深厚了不少 - 是啊 确实\N{\fnArial\fs30}- a really long way since homecoming. - Yeah, we have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.45,1:02:48.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,也行是时候…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it's time…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.45,1:02:52.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也许应该用新方法去表达\N{\fnArial\fs30}we start to express ourselves in new ways.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.49,1:02:54.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是 - 你愿意吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - You wanna do it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.82,1:02:57.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 愿意 - 我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - I love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.33,1:03:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,到你说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your turn.{\r}
