Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.81,1:13:20.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,起码我习惯了在校厕扎马\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, at least I learned how to shit in school, buddy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.25,1:13:22.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 芬奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Finch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.28,1:13:25.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 想跳舞吗？- 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wanna dance? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.39,1:13:33.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没有舞伴吗？- 我喜欢追男孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How come you have no date? - I like to keep my options open.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.90,1:13:35.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有份礼物给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got something for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.73,1:13:40.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个安慰奖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Consider it a consolation prize.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.31,1:13:46.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 杰西卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jessica, this is great! Wow!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.31,1:13:50.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我收了你的钱 问心有愧 - 200块全花在酒瓶上？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Felt sorta guilty about taking your money. - You spent $200 on this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.75,1:13:53.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 50块买酒瓶 150块买耳环\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I spent 50 on the flask, 150 on the earrings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.09,1:13:58.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那么…嗯… - 事先声明\N{\fnArial\fs30}- These are, uh… - Let me just clarify…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.09,1:14:02.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不要打我主意 芬奇 - 当然不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}- that you have no chance of scoring with me, Finch. - Of course not!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.59,1:14:05.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和雪门很熟吗 嗯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I take it you and Sherman are pretty close, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.26,1:14:07.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,在派对认识 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You met at that party a while back, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.33,1:14:09.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 那晚我们谈心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we were up all night together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.33,1:14:12.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,谈个一个通宵\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had one of those amazingly deep conversations…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.50,1:14:15.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,互相了解了不少\N{\fnArial\fs30}where you feel like you really get to know someone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.57,1:14:18.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,谈心？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deep conversation, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.94,1:14:21.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把那回事叫做谈心？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that what you call it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.24,1:14:23.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,还可以叫什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What else would I call it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.05,1:14:31.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 各位同学\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Great Falls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.05,1:14:35.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在休息一会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna take a little break. You are beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.39,1:14:41.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真恶心\N{\fnArial\fs30}You suck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.23,1:14:46.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 打扰一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, everyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.90,1:14:49.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry to interrupt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.14,1:14:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为有件事你们应该知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just thought you all should know this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.57,1:14:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,雪门是个大话精\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chuck Sherman is a liar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.31,1:14:56.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没跟他发生过关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never had sex with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.68,1:15:01.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也从没跟任何人发生过关系 我知道 因为他亲口对我说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's never had sex with anyone. I know this because he told me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.15,1:15:05.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说 最多是使用西柚弄一弄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once he tried to screw a grapefruit, but that's all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.09,1:15:08.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 他也说 他一急就会屎裤子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. He also told me that when he gets nervous, he sometimes wets his pants.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.49,1:15:12.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,打扰你们了 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you for your time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.24,1:15:28.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么一个人在这里？- 我觉得没意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Guess what? - Not interested.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.58,1:15:32.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了 准备去史勒别墅吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin. Come on, man. The bus to Stifler's is gonna be here soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.95,1:15:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不去 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm not going. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.95,1:15:38.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.59,1:15:43.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,想不到出现这种情形\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, things didn't really turn out how I wanted them to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.42,1:15:45.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我连自己在做什么都不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I don't even know what I'm doin'.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.86,1:15:49.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本来满有把握\N{\fnArial\fs30}I- I'm acting like I've got everything together tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.33,1:15:53.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,但维琪会问我爱不爱她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that Vicky's gonna ask me if I love her, and…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.10,1:15:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道怎样回答\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what I'm gonna say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.10,1:15:57.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就快如愿以偿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I'm on the brink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.14,1:16:00.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,就快可以做了 本应欢欢天喜地\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just about to do it. I should be psyched.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.81,1:16:04.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者你说得对 我害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Maybe you're right. Maybe I am just scared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.98,1:16:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要消极了 今晚是大日子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Kev. Tonight is the night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.12,1:16:12.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们等足四年 终于开完舞会\N{\fnArial\fs30}We- We are finally going to a post- prom party on the lake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.32,1:16:14.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,到史勒的别墅去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have been waiting for this for four years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.72,1:16:17.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则何必交史勒那种朋友？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why else have we been friends with Stifler all this time, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.79,1:16:21.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,史勒是我们的朋友？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were friends with Stifler?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.26,1:16:23.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.60,1:16:27.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来雪门还是处男\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherman didn't even get laid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.40,1:16:30.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他没有做过？- 而且当众屎湿裤子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He didn't? - No, he pissed himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.21,1:16:33.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.04,1:16:36.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,上车才告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll tell you on the bus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.08,1:16:39.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我回去拿睡袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna go inside and grab my bag.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.32,1:16:41.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者该带那怪妞出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}My date too, perhaps?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.52,1:16:45.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,史勒的妈妈离了婚 分得这别墅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stifler's mom got it in the divorce.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.75,1:16:47.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,有次音乐营…\N{\fnArial\fs30}That reminds me of this one time…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.76,1:16:50.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以问你一句话吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, can I ask you a question?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.76,1:16:53.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么只有我说故事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How come you don't have any stories? I've got lots of them, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.49,1:16:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很少出声\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you don't have any.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.76,1:16:58.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我也有很多故事 相信我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I've got stories. Believe me. They're just, uh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.03,1:17:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,但没有音乐营那样纯情\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're just a little more risque than tales of band camp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.87,1:17:06.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,男孩之间的黄色故事？说来听斩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are they gross or something? Like guy stuff? Tell me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.51,1:17:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你既然要听 我说好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. You want a story?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.51,1:17:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,史勒喝过一杯加「料」的啤酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's a story. Stifler finds this beer…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.28,1:17:18.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 全屋最好的房间 - 凯文 这很完美\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is the nicest room in the house. - Kev, it's perfect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.40,1:17:33.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们打算做爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys are gonna fuck, aren't ya?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.14,1:17:35.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,下流仔 下流女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuckers! Fuckers, fuckers!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.80,1:17:38.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,下流仔 下流女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuckers, fuckers, fuckers!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.47,1:17:42.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 出去 - 我想看\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Out. - Aw, come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.63,1:18:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有句话要说 海瑟\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's something I've been meaning to tell you, Heather.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.73,1:18:07.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.14,1:18:09.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不轻易说出口 但…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna sound really bad, but, uh, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.50,1:18:12.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.21,1:18:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, uh, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.98,1:18:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是处男\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a virgin, and, uh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.32,1:18:21.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 凯文 吉姆 芬奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, me, Kevin, Jim and Finch were…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.05,1:18:24.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家约定\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all made this pact…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.85,1:18:27.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们争取在中学毕业前\N{\fnArial\fs30}that we would lose our virginity…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.76,1:18:29.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,争取性经验\N{\fnArial\fs30}before high school was over, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.89,1:18:32.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们打算今晚做\N{\fnArial\fs30}and tonight is supposed to be the night that we all do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.96,1:18:37.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样的暗示方法不算最好吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't the best way to proposition me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.13,1:18:39.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 我的意思是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, that's… That's not what I mean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.00,1:18:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}W- What I mean is, uh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.27,1:18:46.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 你知道我为什么退出球赛吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, do you know what made me leave that game?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.11,1:18:50.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到教练对我们说\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, Coach, he was givin' us this speech about…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.21,1:18:52.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,有机会入球 就要乘胜追击\N{\fnArial\fs30}not slacking off when you see the opportunity to score…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.98,1:18:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这样说不见得会好些\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't any better, Chris.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.12,1:18:57.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 我的意思是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you see… You see, Heather, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.29,1:18:59.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得跟你一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}what I realized is that…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.79,1:19:04.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是在进攻龙门\N{\fnArial\fs30}with you, it's… not like I'm running towards a goal…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.76,1:19:08.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是在设法入球\N{\fnArial\fs30}looking for the best way to score.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.16,1:19:11.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,说出来老土 但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}This may sound a little corny, but…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.73,1:19:13.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得自己已经胜出\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel like I've already won.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.50,1:19:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我来说 你很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, uh, I care about you a lot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.11,1:19:24.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,欧兹 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oz, I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.61,1:19:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你叫我欧兹？- 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You called me Oz. - Well, yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.02,1:19:30.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的朋友个个都叫你欧兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's what your friends call you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.02,1:19:34.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得自己是你的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I feel like I'm one of your friends now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.12,1:19:37.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的女朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}And… your girlfriend?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.60,1:20:01.57,Note,0,0,0,0,,（非请勿进）
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.66,1:20:13.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,走失了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are ya lost?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.13,1:20:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是史勒的妈妈…？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're Stifler's mom. Uh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.07,1:20:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是走失了 只是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, not lost. Just, um, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.87,1:20:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,到处逛逛\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know, taking the tour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.31,1:20:32.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你容许我们来开派对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, uh, thank you for letting us have this wonderful party.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.65,1:20:35.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的儿子不准我反对\N{\fnArial\fs30}As if there was an alternative in the matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.06,1:20:42.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,玩得开心吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you enjoying yourself?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.52,1:20:45.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯母 我喝得有点飘飘然\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm… three sheets to the wind, ma'am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.06,1:20:48.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so happy for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.50,1:20:50.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,酒可以松弛神经\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it takes the edge off, doesn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.43,1:20:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你的小女伴呢？- 我约不到女伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's your little date tonight? - No date. It was…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.77,1:20:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为一宗厕所事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a bathroom incident.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.24,1:21:02.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 算了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Pardon me? - Never mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.61,1:21:09.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,有没有东西喝？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have anything to drink?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.08,1:21:11.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,啤酒在楼上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe the kegs are upstairs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.32,1:21:14.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,啤酒是小儿科 我要正货\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is what the cretins drink.{\r}
